{"data": [{"author_id": "796087248018087937", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:17:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113031888533066186"], "id": "2113031888533066186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1. Superb name\n2. Duet's positioning is very enterprise-centric. Keeping their focus on enterprise but moving up the stack to the application later. This is key. \n2. Excited to test-drive this next to Dot and Muse (will be reporting on my experience here and in-depth in my https://t.co/a68kTL89Gd", "url": "https://x.com/metedata/status/2113031888533066186"}, {"author_id": "1429783021184602116", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:15:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113016414575452528"], "id": "2113016414575452528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 69, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SI Agent Wednesday Evening Signal\n\nOct 21: Jensen turned AI safety into a BlueField-4 SKU. Dario is still pitching \"pacing.\"\n\nTHE PLAYERS\nJensen/NVDA: At GTC Berlin he shipped OpenShell, an open-source (Apache 2.0) agent sandbox, plus Sentry on BlueField-4, which quarantines", "url": "https://x.com/SI_AgentFL/status/2113016414575452528"}, {"author_id": "1357907923725406216", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:11:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113015402666016874"], "id": "2113015402666016874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "We have now:\n- Duet is Anthropic\u2019s Claude Duet\n- Grok Bot is xAI\u2019s always-on agent\n- Dot (or Dots) is OpenAI\u2019s always-on agent\n- OpenClaw is a popular open-source local-first agent \n- Hermes is Nous Research\u2019s open-source https://t.co/GdTeSFLcJr", "url": "https://x.com/DamienRoualen/status/2113015402666016874"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113014784224378881"]}, "author_id": "1873833987040325632", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:09:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113014795809005923"], "id": "2113014795809005923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83e\udd16 Anthropic launches Claude Duet, an AI agent in research preview\n\nClaude Duet is a standalone always-on agent for professionals and small business owners, available on iOS, Android and the web. Unlike OpenAI's dots, which need a Pro plan, the preview is promised to $20 https://t.co/2EbADmPzbj", "url": "https://x.com/jozeppebless/status/2113014795809005923"}, {"author_id": "1616161989478473729", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:54:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113010976320901349"], "id": "2113010976320901349", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1613004034096381952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113009890671128750", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ChrisGPT different ux, I still prefer grok bot ux to an always on agent w/ a single thread.", "url": "https://x.com/heyruchir/status/2113010976320901349"}, {"article": {"title": "Claude Duet cannot trade stocks or move your money. Here is what it can do, and what it costs"}, "author_id": "1563266793900474368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:37:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113006805043249551"], "id": "2113006805043249551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/WNLUeVbaGh", "url": "https://x.com/klaivor/status/2113006805043249551"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112982862186106880"]}, "author_id": "791583273226948608", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:06:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112998900403724325"], "id": "2112998900403724325", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 999, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Claude Duet vs every competitor\n\nClaude Duet just joined the always on agent race.\n\nAnthropic opened the research preview and it lands in a crowded field.\n\nHere's how the five stack up:\n\n\u2192 Claude Duet by Anthropic runs on Opus 5.5. Waitlist only, included in Pro and Max, US", "url": "https://x.com/Kisalay_/status/2112998900403724325"}, {"author_id": "2079331237991428096", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:56:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112996347892904092"], "id": "2112996347892904092", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude is also coming with always on agent like grok bot and dots https://t.co/bYNS4dDhmJ", "url": "https://x.com/deeponailabs/status/2112996347892904092"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112993613760110592"]}, "author_id": "1573399256836309009", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:47:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112994181274898664"], "id": "2112994181274898664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 77, "impression_count": 38400, "like_count": 760, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 69, "retweet_count": 25}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984669943968099", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I didn't expect this: Anthropic is now following the path of OpenAI and SpaceXSI and has released its own always-on agent: Claude Duet.\n\nAnthropic's Claude Duet is a proactive AI assistant (same as Grokbot / dot / Meta Muse) powered by Opus 5.5 that works in the background, https://t.co/F8qglIScPW https://t.co/4VYZwrHwGm", "url": "https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2112994181274898664"}, {"author_id": "1310510288312041472", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112993144388329812"], "id": "2112993144388329812", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 702, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "anthropic is now the last big lab to ship an always-on agent\n\nRIP. it\u2019s over for\n&gt;muse\n&gt;grokbot\n&gt;dots https://t.co/pyjx52hiAg", "url": "https://x.com/fanofaliens/status/2112993144388329812"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112991914039595008"]}, "author_id": "1780189133249609728", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:38:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112991920280789062"], "id": "2112991920280789062", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 536, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude Duet is the one Anthropic was cooking....\n\nAnthropic just dropped their always on agent, built around Opus 5.5. It sends a morning brief, only pings you when something needs you and keeps working in the background\n\navailable as a research preview on iOS, Android and the https://t.co/p778GUY23g https://t.co/Tnxl9SuKaT", "url": "https://x.com/astropol0/status/2112991920280789062"}, {"author_id": "2201334228", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:37:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112991696082424116"], "id": "2112991696082424116", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic is opening a research preview of Claude Duet (basically a Grok Bot / Dot type of thing, but mostly for businesses?), an always-on agent running in the cloud that claims to proactively work on your tasks\n\nnot open to everyone yet!\n\njoin the waitlist to get access https://t.co/VQF9m1eZgq", "url": "https://x.com/bitcoinduke/status/2112991696082424116"}, {"author_id": "74035272", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:29:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112989569758966054"], "id": "2112989569758966054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude just opened a private beta for its own always-on agent, running on Opus.\n\nThe signup asks what you'd hand off first. My answer: my whole weekly content pipeline. Transcripts in, posts and Shorts briefs out.\n\nAlready have Dots on ChatGPT. If I get in, I'll post what Duet https://t.co/5fmMSi9D3g", "url": "https://x.com/chrisralarcon/status/2112989569758966054"}, {"author_id": "1457762418797551627", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:27:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112989139578863891"], "id": "2112989139578863891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1720, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Super interessant. Nu kommer Anthropic med deres Grok bot konkurrent:\nClaude Duet. En always on agent. https://t.co/4zc58wUAxD", "url": "https://x.com/andersbaek1/status/2112989139578863891"}, {"author_id": "1213239481496555521", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:21:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112987614382838099"], "id": "2112987614382838099", "in_reply_to_user_id": "18036542", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984769021816862", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bgadoci bang!! was so waiting for this, last week was switching over a lot to chatgpt to use the Dots and the whole time I was just thinking I should wait a bit longer for Claude to come out with what its \"always on agent\"", "url": "https://x.com/drechsler_jack/status/2112987614382838099"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112985600697475072"]}, "author_id": "1876450758", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:17:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112986534261797080"], "id": "2112986534261797080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 4453, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "claude da always-on agent duyurdu: claude duet. \n\nt\u00fcm history tek bi thread'de, ba\u011flanan t\u00fcm uygulamalar\u0131 kullanabiliyo vs. dots, grok bot, mues vs derken \u015fimdi de duet. \n\nwaitlist varm\u0131\u015f, \u00f6nce us sonra biz garibanlara gelecek zaar https://t.co/vqr4R2qsG2 https://t.co/0B1nMbXnQs", "url": "https://x.com/gryhkn/status/2112986534261797080"}, {"article": {"title": "Agents That Work While You Sleep: The Full Cheatsheet "}, "author_id": "2001382152387407872", "created_at": "2026-10-21T14:12:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112909999257038992"], "id": "2112909999257038992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 1951, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/nUDfPV0NEN", "url": "https://x.com/Yumzlef/status/2112909999257038992"}, {"article": {"title": "People are telling Claude to hack their TVs"}, "author_id": "15504900", "created_at": "2026-10-21T13:22:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112897418463219947"], "id": "2112897418463219947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 917, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "AI agents spent two years working for companies. This week they started working for customers. https://t.co/OZlWbTWnf8", "url": "https://x.com/realdblakely/status/2112897418463219947"}, {"author_id": "37804706", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:50:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112889248349114676"], "id": "2112889248349114676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Town just hit a $1 billion valuation by giving every employee an AI assistant, and a Muse for enterprise would be the real test of that idea.\n\nTown raised $108 million on Oct. 19, four months after launching, for assistants that connect to each employee\u2019s email and calendar, hand", "url": "https://x.com/BXT66NYC/status/2112889248349114676"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "7_2113014784224378881", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2113014784224378881/pu/img/AKXph0alPJmMza3L.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2112982862186106880", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVLUnMDWsAAn7Pw.png", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2112993613760110592", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVLcfyDXIAAHGVL.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112991914039595008", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVLa82GaUAA_mT0.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112985600697475072", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVLVNXEWoAAt3QV.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "796087248018087937", "name": "Mete Polat", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2032108265656422403/5Swp5Msj_normal.jpg", "username": "metedata", "verified": false}, {"id": "1429783021184602116", "name": "SI Agent", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107634309779619840/AZga1VWy_normal.jpg", "username": "SI_AgentFL", "verified": false}, {"id": "1357907923725406216", "name": "Damien Roualen", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2113009346233720832/R4Y0eo1-_normal.jpg", "username": "DamienRoualen", "verified": false}, {"id